# MASTER DEVELOPMENT PROMPT
## Pakistan Business Compliance AI — A Real-Data, AI-Powered Compliance Research Platform

Act as a senior full-stack software architect, senior AI/ML engineer, UI/UX designer, database engineer, cybersecurity engineer, and QA engineer.

Build a complete, functional, professional web application named **Pakistan Business Compliance AI**.

This must be a real, working software product—not a static frontend, mockup, landing-page-only project, or chatbot demo with hardcoded answers.

The application will help entrepreneurs, startups, freelancers, small and medium-sized businesses, accountants, and business consultants in Pakistan understand business registration, taxation, and regulatory compliance using authentic official Pakistani government sources.

The final result should have the quality, usability, visual polish, and consistency expected from a modern professional SaaS product.

